    /* ── 2026-11-21 (John): MOTOR YIELD vs MD from the Pason CSV (10-min rows) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
     * Same definition as public/js/motorYield.js (Slide Sheet): MY = interval dogleg / slid length x 30 (°/30 m) = DLS x CL / slid.
     * Dogleg between two stations: minimum curvature, theta = acos(sinI1 sinI2 cos(A2-A1) + cosI1 cosI2) (ISCWSA eBook App. D3).
     * IMPLEMENTATION CHOICES (stated, not from a source):
