     *    main bore only (rows up to the first hole-depth drop > 10 m). Inc / Azi at a bin edge = linear interpolation (Azi wrapped).
     *  - Bins of 'MY bin length' (default 30 m) from 0 m. Slid / rotated metres in a bin: hole-depth increases of the drilling rows
